OL,3,GNEWSAHigh winds postpone
OL,4,ANorthamptonshire Day event
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event celebrating Northamptonshire's
OL,7,Fheritage has been postponed because of
OL,8,Fforecast high winds.
OL,10,FMore than 50 organisations from across
OL,11,Fthe county had been due to take part in
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire Day in Kettering on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FNorth and West Northamptonshire
OL,16,Fcouncils said they made the "difficult
OL,17,Fdecision" to postpone the event as
OL,18,Fpredicted conditions could pose a risk
OL,19,Fto visitors, staff and exhibitors.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
