OL,3,GNEWSAHigh winds postpone
OL,4,ANorthamptonshire Day event
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a joint statement, they said: "The
OL,7,Fcouncils are currently considering
OL,8,Foptions for a future Northamptonshire
OL,9,FDay celebration, with the possibility
OL,10,Fof a rescheduled event next year."
